  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards In-PNG Scholarships - Intake 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment relates to the component awarded for studying in Papua New Guinea (PNG), is linked to OASIS and supports scholarships for the 2025 intake. Support includes payment of tuition fees, in-country training costs, medical, general living expenses and other administrative allowances as required. These awardees address front line service delivery in health, education and transport.</narrative>
  </description>
